#: ../../functions/func_truncate.rst:6
msgid "$truncate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_truncate.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$truncate(text,length)**"
msgstr "用法：**$truncate(text,length)**"

#: ../../functions/func_truncate.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_truncate.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 0.12"
msgstr "实现：Picard 0.12"

#: ../../functions/func_truncate.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_truncate.rst:14
msgid "Truncate ``text`` to ``length``. If ``length`` is less than 0, then the value used is the number of characters in ``text`` plus ``length`` (e.g.: ``$truncate(abcd,-1)`` is the same as ``$truncate(abcd,3)``). If ``length`` is missing or a negative number greater than the number of characters in ``text``, the function will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"将 ``text`` 截断为 ``length``。如果 ``length`` 小于 0，则使用的值是 ``text`` "
"中的字符数加上 ``length``（例如：``$truncate(abcd,-1)`` 与 ``$truncate"
"(abcd,3)`` 相同）。如果 ``length`` 缺失或为负数且大于 ``text`` 中的字符数，函"
"数将返回空字符串。"

